acters</strong> to choose from </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Save files, in case your friends want to try </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/71e230e08699e9a04a3ada568a74d579.poster.avif?t=1750808245\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/71e230e08699e9a04a3ada568a74d579.gif?t=1750808245\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>Dokimon takes inspiration from the &quot;GameBoy Color&quot; era of games, without the chunkiness of some of those old systems. (Like, the game's systems.. not the consoles, we love those).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">On your adventures, you'll be able to:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect over 140 unique</strong>, original monsters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on an adventure expanding across <strong>15+ towns</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore several routes, caves, shrines, seas, and mountains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete a<strong> 15-20 hour story mode</strong>, and endless fun for completionists </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track down rare monsters to unlock the\u00a0<strong>game's post story</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience 7 alt-palettes for each monster (1 of which is incredibly rare) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go FISHING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Built to last. Dokimon: Quest was developed in the MonMae engine (aka Luna)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019300/extras/b1c3c9f24f18fb9d1d5